# Order Management System Implementation Plan

The user wants to fix the checkout process and add an admin panel to manage orders, including tracking who checked out and the shipping status.

## Proposed Changes

### 1. Database Layer
- **[MODIFY] [Order_model.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/models/Order_model.php)**: 
    - Update [add_order_items](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/models/Order_model.php#23-46) to handle `category` and deduct stock from the correct TCG table.
    - Add `get_all_orders()` and `get_order_details($id)` for the admin panel.
    - Add `update_order_status($id, $status)` for manipulation.

### 2. Checkout Flow
- **[MODIFY] [Checkout.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/controllers/Checkout.php)**:
    - Ensure `category` is passed to [add_order_items](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/models/Order_model.php#23-46).
- **[MODIFY] [order_items table]**: Add `category` column (to be done via SQL or Model).

### 3. Admin Order Management
- **[MODIFY] [Admin.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/controllers/Admin.php)**:
    - Add `manage_orders()` method.
    - Add `view_order($id)` method.
    - Add `update_order_ajax()` method.
- **[NEW] [manage_orders.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/admin/manage_orders.php)**: List all orders with customer names, totals, and statuses.
- **[NEW] [view_order.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/admin/view_order.php)**: Detailed view of an order with item breakdown and "Mark as Sent" controls.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Place a test order for multiple TCGs (Pokémon + One Piece).
- Verify stock is deducted from both `pokemon_cards` and [onepiece_cards](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/controllers/Admin.php#153-160).
- Verify the order appears in the Admin dashboard.

### Manual Verification
- Log in as admin, navigate to "Manage Orders".
- Click "View" on a pending order.
- Click "Mark as Sent" and verify status updates to 'Shipped'.
